     The Korean Society for Cultural Anthropology (사단법인 한국문화인류학회, KCA)
   - 『Cross-Cultural Studies』 (『비교문화연구』):
     Institute of Cross-Cultural Studies, Seoul National University (서울대학교 비교문화연구소, ICCS)

